      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I'd call it mild. I notice it more with stress. It just comes and goes. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I've had a stiff neck too, for one week. As for stiff neck, moderate, really. Honestly, a couple of times a week. Oh, you know, and tired eyes. That's been about the same, about three months. Oh, uh, as for tired eyes, pretty severe, if I'm being honest.",
